        "statement": "Compactor settings passed with `boltdb.shipper.compactor.`-prefixed CLI flags stop being honoured because those flags are removed in 3.0.0.",
        "remediation": "Replace every --boltdb.shipper.compactor.* CLI flag with its --compactor.* equivalent before upgrading.",
        "severity": "high"
      },
      "statement": "Compactor CLI flags that use the prefix `boltdb.shipper.compactor.` are removed"
